ries and refreshed performance metrics.\",\n      \"when\": \"A client sends POST /lots/{lotId}/weight-readings.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The requested lot and reading exist and the replacement weight-reading request is valid.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-1.24\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned WeightMutationResponse contains the updated reading series and refreshed performance metrics.\",\n      \"when\": \"A client sends PUT /lots/{lotId}/weight-readings/{readingId}.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The requested lot and reading exist and deletion is permitted.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-1.25\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned WeightMutationResponse contains the remaining reading series and refreshed performance metrics.\",\n      \"when\": \"A client sends DELETE /lots/{lotId}/weight-readings/{readingId}.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The requested lot exists.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-1.26\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned metrics contain daysOnFeed, totalWeightGainLb, averageDailyGainLbPerDay, totalFeedConsumedAsFedLb, feedConversionRatio, feedCostPerPoundOfGain, and projectedShipDate.\",\n      \"when\": \"A client sends GET /lots/{lotId}/performance.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Operational records exist and startDate and endDate are valid.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-1.27\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the returned report contains the requested dates and pens, lots, inventory, planAlignment, and rationUsage lists.\",\n      \"when\": \"A client sends GET /reports/operations with the required date range.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Weight and feeding records exist and the date range and optional breed, sex, and penId filters are valid.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-1.28\",\n      \"level\": \"ap